And what was her purpose?

290
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,640
Everyone, think about it carefully.

291
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:09,080
The time when Mingjinbao collapsed

292
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:11,280
and the movement of the funds behind it.

293
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:13,880
But Cui Xiangqin killing herself

294
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,760
is just insane.

295
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:18,280
Who would gamble with their own life?

296
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:21,180
She did it just to direct
suspicion to Cheng Jia.

297
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:21,840
I think...

298
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,320
That's highly unlikely.

299
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:24,680
Then I have another theory.

300
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:26,480
Do you guys remember what Liang Enqi said?

301
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:28,600
Cui Xiangqin specifically warned her.

302
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:29,640
No matter what happens,

303
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:30,600
never come back.

304
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:33,770
Zhou Yan,

305
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:35,320
sync with the police

306
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:37,920
and keep a close eye
on Liang Enqi's movements.

307
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:43,580
Weiwei,

308
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:45,780
your uncle is missing.

309
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:48,570
He's a grown man. How could he get lost?

310
00:11:48,680 --> 00:11:49,640
He just is.

311
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:51,250
Please help me find him.

312
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:53,200
Are you hiding something from me?

313
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:54,120
Never mind that.

314
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:55,320
Just hurry up and find him.

315
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:57,480
I'm worried something happened to him.

316
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,810
What exactly happened?

317
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:05,050
Who is it?

318
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:06,680
Maintenance.

319
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:08,340
A previous guest reported

320
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,880
a toilet issue in your room.

321
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:10,880
I'm here to fix it.

322
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:13,520
I just checked in.
How is it already broken?

323
00:12:13,520 --> 00:12:14,120
Sorry

324
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:15,000
to bother you.

325
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,480
What do you want?

326
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:20,140
Who are you?

327
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:21,320
Don't scream.

328
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:24,640
Is your mother Cui Xiangqin?

329
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:26,120
Did she give you a USB drive?

330
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:26,760
Hand it over.

331
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:27,920
Why should I give it to you?

332
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:29,280
My mom left it for me.

333
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:30,410
Cut the crap.

334
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:31,520
Do you know

335
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:34,120
how many terrible things
your mother has done?

336
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,520
She made me lose everything.

337
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:37,080
But I'm innocent!

338
00:12:37,280 --> 00:12:38,520
I don't know anything.

339
00:12:38,520 --> 00:12:39,480
Cut the crap.

340
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:40,650
Hand it over.

341
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:44,640
Believe it or not, I'll kill you.

342
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:45,640
I'll give it to you.

343
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:46,700
I'll give it to you.

344
00:12:46,880 --> 00:12:48,410
The USB drive is over there.

345
00:12:49,640 --> 00:12:50,900
Don't play any tricks.

346
00:12:51,800 --> 00:12:52,200
Got it?

347
00:12:54,520 --> 00:12:55,450
I'm telling you,

348
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:57,810
this knife has no mercy.

349
00:13:01,640 --> 00:13:02,440
Smart choice.

350
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:13,600
Huang,

351
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:15,540
Zhang Qing.

352
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:19,160
No, Huang,

353
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:19,760
I'm

354
00:13:20,040 --> 00:13:20,900
in a hurry here.

355
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:21,800
In a hurry?

356
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:24,370
Any news on the flash drive
I asked you to find?

357
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:27,600
Let me tell you, Zhang Qing,

358
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:28,640
don't play dumb with me.

359
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:29,880
My guys saw you.

360
00:13:30,800 --> 00:13:31,360
No, no, no,

361
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:31,760
Huang,

362
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:33,280
I was just messing with you.

363
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:33,840
I have the flash drive.

364
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:35,570
Did you only find a flash drive?

365
00:13:35,920 --> 00:13:37,240
What about the password?

366
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:37,840
Password?

367
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:40,200
This thing needs a password?

368
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:44,800
It's fine.

369
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,200
Just come over first.

370
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:47,460
Bring the flash drive.

371
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:49,040
I'll figure something out.

372
00:13:49,040 --> 00:13:49,240
No,

373
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:50,120
Huang,

374
00:13:50,520 --> 00:13:51,000
it wasn't easy

375
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:53,040
for me to find this flash drive.

376
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:54,840
I can't do it for nothing, right?

377
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:56,320
I won't treat you badly.

378
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:58,570
When have I ever lied to you?

379
00:13:58,680 --> 00:13:59,080
Right?

380
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:00,080
Come over.

381
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:03,360
You're always so generous, Huang.

382
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,760
I'll head over right now.

383
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,000
Where's the person in this room?

384
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,160
They already checked out.

385
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:18,890
Checked out?

386
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,210
Yeah, no one's here.

387
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:25,960
This is killing me.

388
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:32,740
How about this?

389
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:34,240
I'll send you a location.

390
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:35,100
Just come over.

391
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:38,130
Alright.

392
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:52,010
The suburbs.

393
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:53,920
Are you kidding me?

394
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:55,650
Boss,

395
00:14:56,400 --> 00:14:57,400
if we don't go,

396
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:59,250
what about the flash drive?

397
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:03,680
He can run, but he can't hide.

398
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:06,080
Does he have a sister?

399
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:07,380
Yes.

400
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:08,400
Zhang Yun.

401
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:10,210
Let's go.

402
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:12,010
Let's go.

403
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:13,170
Qiqi,

404
00:15:13,880 --> 00:15:15,520
that person didn't hurt you before,
did they?

405
00:15:15,520 --> 00:15:16,120
No.

406
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:17,700
Then I understand.

407
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:19,930
They were just after that flash drive.

408
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:22,980
As long as you're okay.

409
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:24,480
Let me ask you.

410
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:26,120
What exactly is in that flash drive

411
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:26,840
your mother left you?

412
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:27,680
Have you looked at it?

413
00:15:27,680 --> 00:15:29,740
I haven't had the time to check it yet.

414
00:15:30,520 --> 00:15:33,580
My mom told me before
that she would leave me some money.

415
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:35,920
I don't know if it has anything
to do with this flash drive.

416
00:15:35,920 --> 00:15:38,240
Then this matter is
even more complicated now.

417
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:40,000
I seriously suspect your mother's death

418
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,730
is related to that flash drive.

419
00:15:41,880 --> 00:15:43,240
And we have no idea

420
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,700
how many eyes are watching you right now.

421
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:47,960
We'd better call the police immediately.

422
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:48,290
Okay.

423
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:54,120
Qing,

424
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:55,600
you're finally back.

425
00:15:57,280 --> 00:15:57,880
This is...

426
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:58,920
What's wrong?

427
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:01,900
Weiwei is here.

428
00:16:02,280 --> 00:16:03,680
Why are you so free today?

429
00:16:03,680 --> 00:16:04,810
I'm waiting for you.

430
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:06,560
What have you been

431
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:07,560
busy with lately?

432
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:09,160
Nothing much.

433
00:16:09,760 --> 00:16:10,560
Nothing much?

434
00:16:11,120 --> 00:16:12,280
Where have you been these past two days?

435
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:14,200
I was worried sick, you know?

436
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:15,280
What's there to worry about?

437
00:16:15,280 --> 00:16:17,000
I'm a grown man, what could happen to me?

438
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:18,200
It's fine, it's fine.

439
00:16:19,120 --> 00:16:21,200
I've figured it out these past two days.

440
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:22,160
Money isn't important.

441
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:23,120
As long as you're safe,

442
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:24,780
that's better than anything.

443
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:25,280
Money?

444
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:27,500
What money?

445
00:16:32,760 --> 00:16:34,820
Are you two hiding something from me?

446
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,100
Zhang Qing,

447
00:16:40,280 --> 00:16:41,360
not talking, huh?

448
00:16:41,680 --> 00:16:43,520
There are surveillance cameras
everywhere outside now.

449
00:16:43,520 --> 00:16:45,360
I can find out exactly
what you've done with one check.

450
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:47,360
Did you forget what I do for a living?

451
00:16:49,240 --> 00:16:50,770
Just tell the kid the truth.

452
00:16:50,880 --> 00:16:52,400
We are victims too.

453
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:54,320
Maybe the kid

454
00:16:54,680 --> 00:16:56,280
can give us some advice.

455
00:16:56,680 --> 00:16:57,360
Okay, okay,

456
00:16:57,600 --> 00:16:58,400
I'll tell you.

457
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:00,800
Weiwei,

458
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:02,440
here's the thing.

459
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:04,119
Your mom and I

460
00:17:04,119 --> 00:17:06,250
bought something called Mingjinbao.

461
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:08,730
All our money

462
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:09,680
is stuck in it.

463
00:17:10,119 --> 00:17:11,450
And the people ran away.

464
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:13,490
How much?

465
00:17:14,040 --> 00:17:14,640
150,000.

466
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:16,560
The dowry I saved for you.

467
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:17,800
You are so ignorant.

468
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:18,240
Mom,

469
00:17:18,599 --> 00:17:20,930
why didn't you discuss this with me first?

470
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:23,280
Don't blame anyone

471
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:24,920
but that guy called Brother Huang.

472
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:25,880
He said he had inside information.

473
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:26,740
Brother Huang?

474
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:28,610
What's his name?

475
00:17:33,560 --> 00:17:34,800
His name is Huang Xinze.

476
00:17:34,800 --> 00:17:36,860
He said he's in charge of Mingjinbao.

477
00:17:37,680 --> 00:17:38,720
You are so foolish.

478
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:40,280
Do you know who he is?

479
00:17:40,280 --> 00:17:42,140
He's a fugitive suspect in a case.

480
00:17:44,880 --> 00:17:46,280
Do you have anything else

481
00:17:46,520 --> 00:17:48,050
to do with this Huang Xinze?

482
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:48,600
Tell me!

483
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:49,680
Right, right, right.

484
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:52,810
He asked me to find a USB drive
for him a couple of days ago.

485
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:53,410
This one.

486
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:56,810
Where did you get it?

487
00:17:57,440 --> 00:17:59,570
Cui Xiangqin's daughter gave it to me.

488
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:01,770
You forced her, didn't you?

489
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:03,140
I didn't force her.

490
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:05,260
I just scared her a little.

491
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:06,260
Scared her?

492
00:18:06,680 --> 00:18:07,400
That's a crime,

493
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:08,330
do you know that?

494
00:18:13,120 --> 00:18:14,580
Is it really that serious?

495
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:15,580
Weiwei,

496
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:16,210
t-t-then

497
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:17,360
what should we do?

498
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:19,480
Come with me to turn yourself in.

499
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:21,040
Weiwei,

500
00:18:21,040 --> 00:18:21,400
he is

501
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:23,280
your own uncle.

502
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:25,520
He has already done something wrong.

503
00:18:25,520 --> 00:18:26,720
I'm a public servant.

504
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:29,980
You're making me knowingly break the law,
don't you get it?

505
00:18:30,680 --> 00:18:32,120
Come with me to turn yourself in.

506
00:18:32,120 --> 00:18:33,040
Show a good attitude.

507
00:18:33,040 --> 00:18:34,570
Explain the facts clearly.

508
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:37,610
Maybe you'll get a lenient treatment.

509
00:18:37,840 --> 00:18:38,120
Weiwei,

510
00:18:38,120 --> 00:18:39,720
how is this a crime?

511
00:18:46,280 --> 00:18:46,920
All right,

512
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:49,200
I'll do as you say.

513
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:51,920
Can you

514
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:54,080
stay for a meal before you go?

515
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:57,170
We might not get the chance
to eat together again.

516
00:19:02,040 --> 00:19:02,640
Let's eat.

517
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:06,900
I'll go serve the rice.

518
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:15,320
Hello,

519
00:19:15,320 --> 00:19:15,720
Wei.

520
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:16,720
Ms. Xu.

521
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:19,560
There's something I need to report to you.

522
00:19:19,560 --> 00:19:20,090
Go ahead.

523
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:22,680
As for the matter with Huang Xinze...

524
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:23,340
Where is he?

525
00:19:24,120 --> 00:19:24,640
Zhang Qing,

526
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:25,080
stop!
